    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6994" root="حبن" body-key="H">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَبِنَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَبَنَ</span></b> ; (S, K;) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُبِنَ</span>; inf. n.
(of the former, TA) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَبَنٌ</span> and (of the latter, TA)
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَبْنٌ</span>; (K;) <i>He</i> (a man) <i>had the dropsy;</i> as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احتبن</span></b> : (KL:) <i>he had a disease in the
belly, whereby it became large and swollen.</i> (K.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَبِنَ عَلَيْهِ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَبَنَ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَبَنٌ</span>,
(TA,) (tropical:)  <i>He became filled with anger against him.</i>
(K. TA.)

